		(property "Substitution basis" "Apple's accelerometer is CANNOT DETERMINE - two visually identical metal-lid parts and no readable marking. 'BMA280' is a teardown assertion this project failed to corroborate, so there is nothing to copy and this is a free choice. The SC7A20 is LGA-12 2x2, 1.8-3.6 V, I2C or SPI, and JLCPCB stocks it as a basic part - which is why it is here rather than a BMA280."
